;
; --------------------------------------------------------------------------
; History:
;
; 1.0 (11.01.2001)
;
; - Initial version, not for release
;
;
; 1.1 (11.01.2001)
;
; - Second internal version
;
; - Added the missing \n at the end of MSG_ABOUT_TRANSLATOR
;
;
; 1.2 (25.01.2001)
;
; - Changed the wording of MSG_ABOUT_REGTO, MSG_AWEB_SCREENTITLE,
;   MSG_NWS_TITLE, MSG_STARTUP_IMAGES, MSG_NEWS_FOLLOW_UP,
;   MSG_NEWS_FOLLOWUP_TITLE, MSG_NEWS_FOLLOWUP_TO_GROUPS,
;   MSG_NEWS_REPLY_TITLE, MSG_SSLWARN_SSL_NO_SSL, MSG_SETTINGS_LOADIMGOFF,
;   MSG_EPART_XAWEB, MSG_EPART_FLUSHED_NORELOAD, MSG_EPART_NOAWEBLIB,
;   MSG_AWEB_FORMRESET, MSG_NAVIGATE_HISTORY, MSG_AWEB_CONNECT,
;   MSG_AWEB_WAITING
;
; - Deleted the superflous colon in MSG_ABOUT_EMAIL
;
; - Changed the genre in MSG_ABOUT_DISTRIBUTED
;
; - Fixed the arrangement of MSG_MAIL_BUTTONS
;
; - Changed the translation of MSG_NEWS_RESET to make it consistent with
;   MSG_MAIL_RESET
;
; - Thanks go to Black Hand for the testing with the print options.
;   This one should be released in the second batch of OS3.9 CDs.
; --------------------------------------------------------------------------
;
